  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical Relief for Flood Affectees In Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The severity of floods rains in Pakistan has left millions without homes, food or medical support. To play our part in the relief efforts, SHINE Humanity is arranging medical relief camps in Sindh province, for the flood-affected population. Through these medical interventions, we will be providing consultations, medicines and water purification tablets.</narrative>
  </description>
